  "description": "Opt-in embeddable hosting library for the Orleans.Lattice Explorer Blazor Server web head. AddLatticeExplorerWeb(...) registers the Razor components, the Explorer UI (navigation and session chrome, credential-aware transport, the sandboxed Lattice App frame host, and the compiled-in Data, Apps, Access, Schema, Tenancy, Replication, Backups, Telemetry and Cluster areas), the state-API connection seam, configuration store, and cookie and data-protection auth plumbing. MapLatticeExplorer(...) maps the interactive server components, static assets, the app frame bootstrap route and the sign-in/sign-out endpoints under a configurable base path, behind static security headers.",
